        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"方程辨认","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下面哪些是含有未知数的等式？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2m＋1＝9"},{"id":"b","text":"n/3＝2"},{"id":"c","text":"8÷2＝4"},{"id":"d","text":"4n＋3"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"前两项含未知数且有等号；第三项只有数字，第四项只是代数式。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"方程的解","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 y＝－3 时，2y－5 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"－11"},{"id":"b","text":"－1"},{"id":"c","text":"1"},{"id":"d","text":"11"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"把 y 换成－3，得到 2×（－3）－5＝－6－5＝－11。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"一次方程辨认","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"方程 x＋y＝7 含有两个未知数，因此它不是一元一次方程。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"“一元”要求只有一个未知数，而这里有 x、y 两个未知数，不符合条件。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"方程的解","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"哪一个数是方程 3y－4＝8 的解？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"－4"},{"id":"b","text":"2"},{"id":"c","text":"4"},{"id":"d","text":"12"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"把 y＝4 代入，3×4－4＝8，与方程右边相等，所以 y＝4 是解。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"方程的解","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列哪些方程的解为 x＝－2？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3x＋1＝－5"},{"id":"b","text":"2x－3＝－7"},{"id":"c","text":"x＋2＝4"},{"id":"d","text":"5x＝10"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"代入－2，前两式左边是－5、－7，分别等于右边；后两式左边是 0、－10，不成立。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-concepts-r09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-concepts","capabilityTag":"含参条件","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"关于 x 的方程（b＋3）x＝6 是一元一次方程，b 不能取哪个值？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"－3"},{"id":"b","text":"0"},{"id":"c","text":"3"},{"id":"d","text":"6"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"一次项系数 b＋3 不能为 0，所以 b 不能等于－3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
