        {"id":"g7u-c5-basic-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-basic","capabilityTag":"系数化一","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"方程（3/4）y＋2＝11 的解是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"y＝6"},{"id":"b","text":"y＝9"},{"id":"c","text":"y＝12"},{"id":"d","text":"y＝16"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"两边减 2 得（3/4）y＝9，再乘 4/3 得 y＝12。","source":"local-reviewed"}
