        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"数量关系","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"3 支同样的笔共 21 元，每支笔多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3 元"},{"id":"b","text":"7 元"},{"id":"c","text":"18 元"},{"id":"d","text":"24 元"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"设每支 x 元，由总价＝单价×数量得 3x＝21，解得 x＝7。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"数量关系","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"长方形的长比宽多 3 cm，周长为 26 cm，宽是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5 cm"},{"id":"b","text":"8 cm"},{"id":"c","text":"10 cm"},{"id":"d","text":"13 cm"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"设宽为 x cm，长为 x＋3 cm。2(x＋x＋3)＝26，得 4x＋6＝26，解得 x＝5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"列式建模","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"某人现在 x 岁，5 年后他的年龄可表示为 x＋5 岁。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"年龄每经过一年增加一岁，所以 5 年后应在当前年龄基础上加 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"列式建模","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"某车费前 3 km 共 10 元，超过 3 km 的部分每千米 2 元，不计其他费用。行驶 x km（x＞3）的费用可用哪些式子表示？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"10＋2(x－3) 元"},{"id":"b","text":"2x＋4 元"},{"id":"c","text":"10＋2x 元"},{"id":"d","text":"2(x－3) 元"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"超出距离是 x－3 km，费用为起步 10 元加 2(x－3) 元，化简得 2x＋4 元。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"数量关系","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"某商品按原价打八折后售价 64 元，原价是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"51.2 元"},{"id":"b","text":"72 元"},{"id":"c","text":"80 元"},{"id":"d","text":"320 元"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"八折表示售价为原价的 80%。设原价 x 元，0.8x＝64，解得 x＝80。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"列式建模","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"两个连续整数中，较小的数是 n，则较大的数一定是 n＋2。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"连续整数之间相差 1，较大的数应为 n＋1；连续偶数或连续奇数才相差 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"行程关系","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"甲、乙相距 27 km，同时沿同一条直路相向而行，速度分别为 4 km/h、5 km/h，均保持不变，多少小时后相遇？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"1 小时"},{"id":"b","text":"3 小时"},{"id":"c","text":"5 小时"},{"id":"d","text":"9 小时"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"相遇时两人路程之和是 27 km，设 t 小时相遇，(4＋5)t＝27，得 t＝3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"列式建模","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"每本练习本 6 元，买 x 本并另买一个 8 元的笔袋，一共花 26 元。哪些方程正确表达了题意？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"6x＋8＝26"},{"id":"b","text":"6x＝18"},{"id":"c","text":"x＋8＝26"},{"id":"d","text":"6(x＋8)＝26"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"本子的总价是 6x 元，加笔袋 8 元等于 26 元；减去笔袋费用后，本子共花 18 元。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"综合应用","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一项工作，甲单独完成需 6 小时，乙单独完成需 3 小时。两人同时合作，效率不变且互不影响，几小时完成？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2 小时"},{"id":"b","text":"3 小时"},{"id":"c","text":"4 小时"},{"id":"d","text":"9 小时"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"把全部工作看成 1，设合作 x 小时，则 x/6＋x/3＝1，合并得 x/2＝1，解得 x＝2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c5-applications-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c5-applications","capabilityTag":"综合应用","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"成人票每张 20 元，学生票每张 12 元，共买 10 张，合计 152 元。成人票买了多少张？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2 张"},{"id":"b","text":"4 张"},{"id":"c","text":"6 张"},{"id":"d","text":"8 张"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"设成人票 x 张，学生票 10－x 张，20x＋12(10－x)＝152，得 8x＝32，所以 x＝4。","source":"local-reviewed"}
